---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Map y Wardiau" title_en="Ward Map">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Map y Wardiau</span><span lang="en">Ward Map</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <a href="/councillors/"><span lang="cy">Cynghorwyr</span><span lang="en">Councillors</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Map y Wardiau</span><span lang="en">Ward Map</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content">
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Map Ffiniau Wardiau</span><span lang="en">Ward Boundary Map</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Mae Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan yn cynnwys pedair ward: Llansannan, Bylchau, Groes a Bryn Rhyd-yr-Arian. Mae'r map isod yn dangos ffin ardal gyfan y cyngor cymuned a'r prif bentrefi. Rydym yn cadarnhau'r ffiniau rhwng y pedair ward a byddant yn cael eu hychwanegu pan fyddant ar gael.</p>
    <p lang="en">Llansannan Community Council has four wards: Llansannan, Bylchau, Groes and Bryn Rhyd-yr-Arian. The map below shows the boundary of the whole community council area and the main villages. The boundaries between the four wards are being confirmed and will be added when available.</p>

    <!-- Map container -->
    <div id="ward-map" style="height:480px;border-radius:6px;margin:1.5rem 0;border:1px solid var(--border)" aria-label="Ward boundary map" role="application"></div>

    <p lang="cy" style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-muted)">Sylwer: Ffin y gymuned: data Arolwg Ordnans (Boundary-Line) trwy mySociety MapIt, Hawlfraint y Goron a hawl cronfa ddata, Trwydded Llywodraeth Agored. Nid yw'n dangos ffiniau'r wardiau unigol.</p>
    <p lang="en" style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-muted)">Note: Community boundary: Ordnance Survey Boundary-Line data via mySociety MapIt, © Crown copyright and database right, Open Government Licence. It does not show the individual ward boundaries.</p>

    <p>
      <a href="/councillors/ward-profiles/"><span lang="cy">Proffiliau wardiau →</span><span lang="en">Ward profiles →</span></a>
    </p>

